   103	/gen-test src/calculator.cpp --output tests/unit/calculator_test.cpp
   104	
   105	✓ 输出路径：tests/unit/calculator_test.cpp
   106	✓ 生成完成：tests/unit/calculator_test.cpp (180 行)
