packages/web/src/content/docs/config.mdx:592:### Disabled providers
packages/web/src/content/docs/config.mdx:594:You can disable providers that are loaded automatically through the `disabled_providers` option. This is useful when you want to prevent certain providers from being loaded even if their credentials are available.
packages/web/src/content/docs/config.mdx:596:```json title="opencode.json"
packages/web/src/content/docs/config.mdx:598:  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
packages/web/src/content/docs/config.mdx:599:  "disabled_providers": ["openai", "gemini"]
packages/web/src/content/docs/config.mdx:604:The `disabled_providers` takes priority over `enabled_providers`.
